  "verseCount": 33,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Khukhwingila mu Yerusalemu ne bikalakala ne lutiri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga baba ne becha Yerusalemu embi ne lukoba lwa Betifake ne Betania, boola khu sikulu sia Miseituni. Yesu aruma babeeka bewe babili ebweeni ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne kamalaka kano, “Cha mu sirekere siili ebweeni esio, nga mwolamo kane munyoole baboyile epunda eng'ana niyo bakhatimilakho tawe, kikangulule mala munderere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omundu yesi yesi aaba ne amureeba sikila ne mukikangulula, muboolele muli Omwami akienya mala alakikobosia khangu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio bacha banyoola epunda yino khu ngila bakiboyile a muliango. Nga yaba ne bakikangulula, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ba baaba ne bemileo bareeba bali, “Siina sikila ne mulikho mukangulula epunda yino?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio bakobosia busa nga Yesu aba ne ababooleele, mala abo bafukiilila babeeka khucha nayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bareera epunda niio Yesu ali, bamwaata chingubo chabwe khu mukoongo kwayo, mala Yesu akiikhalakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babaandu bakali baala chingubo chabwe khu ngila ne babaandi bafuna chisakia che kamasaafu bachisalanisia khu ngila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.118.25+PSA.118.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 118.25-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Babaandu ba baaba ebweeni ne nyuma barakikha khuyokela bali, “Hosana, ali ne chikhabi owicha mwisina lio Mwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wele aane chikhabi khu Bwami bubwiicha bwa Paapa wefwe omwami Daudi, Hosana khuyo oli angaaki! Omwami afume!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu engila mu Yerusalemu, acha mu Lukaangu alola buli siindu sisiabamo. Sikila bwaba bwelabuule, arura acha mu lukoba lwa Betania ne babeeka bewe ekhumi na babili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu alaama kumutuli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endaalo ekhola khabili Yesu aba ne njala nga baba ne baama e Betania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abona kumutuli sinaao kwechuule kamasaafu, acha alolakho ne kulikho chinduli, ne nga ola siimbi anyoola kamasaafu kong'ene. Sikila se siaba siise sie khukhwaama tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aboolela kumutuli okwo ali, “Se aliio yesi yesi olilia enduli khukhwama khwiwe lundi tawe!” Babeeka bewe baulila naloma ario.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu engila mu Lukaangu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga boola mu Yerusalemu, Yesu engila mu Lukaangu mala atimania boosi ba baaba ne bakula lundi ne bakusia. Afumalikha chimeesa che baboofuli be chirupia ne chindebe chaabo ba baaba ne bakusia kamauusi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala khwenya omundu yesi yesi asute siosi siosi a luuya we Lukaangu tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.56.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa. 56.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.7.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer. 7.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nio ekisia babaandu ali, “Se liaandikwa lili, ‘Enju yase elilaangwa enju eye lisaba khu baandu Be Chikholo choosi’ tawe ku? Ne kakhali enywe mwakikholile libina lie banuuli!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basaayi bakhulu ne baandiki nga baulila kano barakikha khuyiima chingila che khukhwira Yesu. Baba ne buuri khu niye sikila babaandu boosi bauka lukali khulwe liliekisia liewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oli bwelabula Yesu ne babeeka bewe barura mu lukoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Liliekisia khukhwama khu mutuli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga ne babirao kumutikhinyi, babona kumutuli okwo kwomile ne chiisi chosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petero akhebulila kakekholekhana mala aboolela Yesu ali, “Omwami, lola! Kumutuli nikwo walaamile kwomile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aabakobosia ali, “Ba ne lisuubila mu Wele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.17.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 17.20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakor. 13.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Musuubisia ndi yesi yesi oboolela sikulu sino khusiuukha siche mu nyanja mala se ali ne liaayaaya mu mwoyo kwewe tawe, ne kakhali asuubile ali nilio alomaloma licha khwekholekha, lilienelio acha khukholelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako muboolela enywe ndi, ne osaba sisiindu mwisaba, suubila oli wasinyoolile lundi olaebwa nisio osabile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.6.14+MAT.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat. 6.14-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lundi nga nilwo wima ne osaba, beela omundu yesi yesi khu siindu siosi siosi, nio Raraawenywe ooli mwikulu amubeele bubwoni bwenywe. [ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne mwaba ne mukhabeela babaandi tawe, aakhaba Raraawenywe ooli mwikulu yesi se alamubeela bubwoni bwenywe tawe.”] ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11.26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Chibibilia chindala se chili ne lunyilili luno tawe.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lireeba khu bunyali bwa Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lundi boola mu Yerusalemu, nga Yesu aba ne akeenda mu Lukaangu, basaayi bakhulu, baandiki ne babemeelesi bamwichakho ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bamureeba bali, “Bunyali siina nibwo oli nabwo khukhola bibiindu bino? Naanu owakhuelesia bunyali buno?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yesu abakobosia ali, “Ndamureeba busa lireeba lilala, ne mwaba ne mungobosia ndamuboolela bunyali siina nibwo ndi nabwo bwe khukhola bibiindu bino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mboolele, Yoana anyoola waena bunyali bwe khubatiisia, bwaama khu Wele namwe khu mundu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barakikha khuyingana babeene ne babeene bareebana bali, “Khulaloma khuli siina? Ne khuloma khuli, ‘Bwaama khu Wele,’ alaloma ali, ‘Siina sikila ne mukhaamusuubila niye tawe?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali khunyala khwaloma khuli, ‘Khukhwama khu mundu’ ku?” (Baba ne buuri khu baandu, sikila buli mulala aamanya ali Yoana aaba omung'oosi.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khwako likobosia liabwe khu Yesu liaba lili, “Se khumanya tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu aabakobosia ali, “Aakhaba ese seesi se muboolela ndi na bunyali siina khukhola bibiindu bino tawe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.11.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
